WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.965 --> 00:00:18.607
was in the portal room with Detective Borzon and a portal operator named Zark.

2
00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:20.548
She held an empty bag.

3
00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:22.970
"Are you sure you don't want help?"

4
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.231
the detective asked.

5
00:00:24.251 --> 00:00:27.233
"Yes, Detective," Cozlin said.

6
00:00:27.253 --> 00:00:29.354
"You're safer on Delkor."

7
00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:31.836
"Why?" the detective asked.

8
00:00:32.444 --> 00:00:34.445
"You're just collecting gold coins, right?"

9
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:36.586
"Um, yeah."

10
00:00:37.566 --> 00:00:39.427
Cozlin had told everyone about the gold.

11
00:00:40.127 --> 00:00:41.648
But she hadn't mentioned the dragon.

12
00:00:42.268 --> 00:00:44.049
She didn't want the king to change his mind.

13
00:00:44.069 --> 00:00:47.071
"I'm going to an alien planet though.

14
00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.572
You never know what might go wrong."

15
00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:52.893
Zark pressed buttons on a computer.

16
00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:54.434
A portal opened.

17
00:00:55.994 --> 00:00:57.455
"The portal leads into that chamber."

18
00:00:58.476 --> 00:00:59.196
Cozlin nodded.

19
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.761
Then she stepped through the portal and into the warm air of the chamber.

20
00:01:05.122 --> 00:01:06.462
The dragon was sleeping again.

21
00:01:07.803 --> 00:01:11.024
Cozlin scooped up some coins and carefully placed them in the bag.

22
00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:15.746
She scooped more coins.

23
00:01:16.847 --> 00:01:18.067
The bag was soon full.

24
00:01:19.148 --> 00:01:21.248
She leaned back through the portal and put it down.

25
00:01:21.268 --> 00:01:24.710
"I need another bag," she whispered.

26
00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.871
Detective Borzon handed her an empty bag.

27
00:01:28.411 --> 00:01:29.552
"Why are you whispering?"

28
00:01:30.612 --> 00:01:31.653
Cozlin didn't answer.

29
00:01:33.294 --> 00:01:34.896
She took the bag and began to fill it.

30
00:01:36.037 --> 00:01:38.098
Snort! Cozlin froze.

31
00:01:38.919 --> 00:01:41.081
The dragon moved slightly, but it didn't wake up.

32
00:01:43.262 --> 00:01:45.925
Cozlin finished filling the bag and returned to the portal.

33
00:01:46.825 --> 00:01:48.327
The detective gave her another bag.

34
00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:50.128
"I heard a sound.

35
00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:52.230
Is something in there with you?"

36
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.071
"What? No!"

37
00:01:54.512 --> 00:01:55.292
Cozlin whispered.

38
00:01:55.312 --> 00:01:57.754
"I, um, sneezed."

39
00:01:58.415 --> 00:01:59.636
She pretended to sneeze.

40
00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:02.113
"Ah-choo! See?"

41
00:02:02.973 --> 00:02:03.793
Zark looked over.

42
00:02:03.813 --> 00:02:05.434
"Why are you whispering?"

43
00:02:06.154 --> 00:02:06.694
"No reason!"

44
00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:08.334
Cozlin hurried away.

45
00:02:09.015 --> 00:02:10.535
She filled one bag after another.

46
00:02:11.475 --> 00:02:14.096
Soon a huge pile of bags stood in the portal room.

47
00:02:15.556 --> 00:02:17.037
"That's enough," Zark said.

48
00:02:17.057 --> 00:02:18.497
"We're running out of space."

49
00:02:19.518 --> 00:02:20.438
"One more bag."

50
00:02:21.178 --> 00:02:23.259
Cozlin grabbed an empty bag and hurried away.

51
00:02:25.759 --> 00:02:27.440
Soon that bag was almost full.

52
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.621
Cozlin grabbed one last handful of coins.

53
00:02:31.421 --> 00:02:32.562
Sweat dripped from her brow.

54
00:02:33.102 --> 00:02:34.203
She reached up to wipe it.

55
00:02:34.763 --> 00:02:37.544
A coin slipped from her hand and bounced off her foot.

56
00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:41.346
Cozlin watched in horror as it rolled toward the dragon's head!

57
00:02:42.846 --> 00:02:43.606
She held her breath.

58
00:02:44.907 --> 00:02:47.808
Luckily the coin slowed down before it reached the dragon.

59
00:02:47.828 --> 00:02:51.230
"Whew!" Cozlin let out a sigh of relief.

60
00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.651
But then the coin began to spin.

61
00:02:54.191 --> 00:02:56.512
The spinning sound grew faster—and louder.

62
00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.781
It echoed off the chamber's walls.

63
00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:02.563
"No!" Cozlin thought, biting her lip.

64
00:03:03.324 --> 00:03:04.584
Finally the coin lay still.

65
00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:06.946
The dragon was still asleep.

66
00:03:07.706 --> 00:03:10.848
Cozlin relaxed, and the rest of the coins slipped from her hand.

67
00:03:11.488 --> 00:03:15.571
Crash! The dragon's eyes shot open.

68
00:03:16.811 --> 00:03:18.492
It stood up and spotted Cozlin.

69
00:03:19.973 --> 00:03:20.694
Cozlin gulped.

70
00:03:23.195 --> 00:03:24.616
Flames shot from the dragon's mouth.

71
00:03:26.248 --> 00:03:28.550
She ducked out of the way and flew toward the portal.

72
00:03:30.111 --> 00:03:32.593
Whump! The dragon landed in front of her.

73
00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.755
Cozlin turned fast to avoid another blast of fire.

74
00:03:36.335 --> 00:03:37.856
The dragon swung its tail.

75
00:03:38.297 --> 00:03:41.759
Wham! It sent Cozlin tumbling across the floor.

76
00:03:46.222 --> 00:03:47.443
Cozlin held up her hand.

77
00:03:48.184 --> 00:03:50.785
Zap! Her laser hit the dragon's nose.

78
00:03:51.866 --> 00:03:54.228
Roar! The chamber shook.

79
00:03:54.976 --> 00:03:56.557
Bits of rock fell from above.

80
00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:01.779
The dragon leaped, its sharp claws sparkling in the torchlight.

81
00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.281
Cozlin zipped under the dragon and flew through the portal.

82
00:04:09.043 --> 00:04:10.943
Comet!" Detective Borzon said.

83
00:04:10.963 --> 00:04:14.745
"What was all that His eyes went wide.

84
00:04:16.046 --> 00:04:17.246
Cozlin spun around.

85
00:04:18.127 --> 00:04:20.368
The dragon's head was poking through the portal!
